Instrument: the SSL semantic-construction workflow, the founder specification and the existing GSE coordinate contract. Specimen: active sparse release 021, exact native definitions and candidate scope predicates. This record belongs to the existing lexicon experiment series. It makes no claim that a partial dictionary is complete.

